  "content": "\n\n<p><strong>*重要提示！！！*：由於 Kureiji Craft 使用自訂實體模型與材質，此資源包需要以下支援：</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>*<a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://optifine.net/home\" rel=\"nofollow\">OPTIFINE</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>…或&nbsp;<em>替代方案</em>：</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>*<a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://modrinth.com/mod/entity-model-features\" rel=\"nofollow\">實體模型功能</a>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://modrinth.com/mod/entitytexturefeatures\" rel=\"nofollow\">實體材質功能</a></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Zombanwa！！！</p>\n<p>Kureiji Craft 是一款將預設殭屍替換為來自 Hololive Indonesia 第二代成員 Kureiji Ollie 的資源包！（並包含一些以 Ollie 為主題的自訂物品）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本資源包新增內容如下：</p>\n<p><strong>*8 種殭屍變體</strong></p>\n<p><strong>*3 件自訂物品</strong></p>\n<p><strong>*重製材質的不死图腾（Udin）</strong></p>\n<p><strong><strong>*重新建模的殭屍頭部</strong></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>所有皮膚／變體均可自然生成（Olivia 除外），但您也可以透過更改名為以下的殭屍來手動切換成您想要的皮膚：</p>\n<p><strong>Kureiji Ollie&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;（對應皮膚 1）</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Bride Ollie</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; （對應皮膚 2）</p>\n<p><strong>Sugarbaby Ollie</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;（對應皮膚 3）</p>\n<p><strong>Ninja Ollie&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; （對應皮膚 4）</p>\n<p><strong>Yukata Ollie&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; （對應皮膚 5）</p>\n<p><strong>Swimsuit Ollie&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>（對應皮膚 6）</p>\n<p><strong>Beach Ollie&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>（對應皮膚 7）</p>\n<p><strong>Olivia&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>（對應皮膚 8）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>您可以透過更改以下物品的名稱來獲得自訂物品：</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>鞘翅更名為：<strong>&nbsp;殭屍鞘翅</strong></p>\n<p>鑽石／下界合金劍更名為：<strong>誠意之路</strong></p>\n<p><span>雕刻南瓜更名為：<strong>誠意之路帽</strong>&nbsp;（用於自訂帽子）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>請確保以下選項皆設為「<strong>開啟</strong>」：</p>\n<p><strong>自訂實體模型</strong><br><strong>隨機實體</strong></p>\n<p><strong>自訂物品</strong></p>\n<p><strong>發光材質</strong></p>\n<p>您可以在以下路徑中找到這些開關：</p>\n<p><strong>選項>影片設定>品質</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>注意：</strong>若您正在使用&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations</a>&nbsp;資源包，這裡有專為其設計的&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/kureiji-craft-x-fresh-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">相容附加模組</a>！</p>",
